        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/bb73d2/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-08-13T17:22:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'd like to add my own question about Zealous Offense...</p><p>When I put this card in play, must I also succeed in doing 3 points of damage with Fanatic or immediately lose the card at the end of that same turn it was played from my hand?</p><p>Pretty new to the game, so any insight on this kind of wording on cards would be appreciated.</p><p>Thanks!</p>",
